---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import profilePicture from "../assets/profile.jpeg";
import background from "../assets/colours.jpg";
---

<div class="hero">
	<div class="stacked-images">
		<Image
			src={profilePicture}
			class="profile"
			alt="Profile Picture"
			width="300"
			height="300"
		/>
		<Image
			src={background}
			class="overlay-image"
			alt="decorative background image"
			width="300"
			height="300"
		/>
	</div>

	<section>
		<span class="poetry">Hello World</span>
		<p>
			I’m Amy Morrison, once a software engineer, now learning to move at a kinder pace.

This is my digital garden: a place for slow thoughts, a wee world of reflections, and a return to my native tongue, English.
		</p>
		<span class="poetry small">Updates will be sporadic :)</span>
	</section>
</div>